\fBallow_\:clients\fR
T}	T{
list of CIDR
T}	T{
\fB[]\fR (any)
T}	T{
Others get \fB554\fR before any session starts (\fBclient_\:not_\:allowed\fR). Empty is right for inbound mail and wrong for submission
T}
