\fBbounds.\:max_\:rectangles_\:per_\:update\fR
T}	T{
int
T}	T{
\fB4096\fR
T}	T{
Rectangles in one framebuffer update. A thousand one\-pixel rectangles cost the viewer a thousand decode calls for one screen
T}
T{
\fBbounds.\:max_\:encoded_\:rectangle\fR
