.PP
The policy object takes \fBupstream_user\fR, \fBallow_channels\fR, \fBallow_requests\fR, \fBallow_subsystems\fR, \fBallow_commands\fR, \fBcommand_rules\fR, \fBallow_env\fR, \fBforward\fR, \fBremote_forward\fR and \fBsftp\fR, each meaning what it means on the listener and each falling back to the listener when unset, plus:
.PP
