required
T}	T{
The enrolment file (\fBxproxyctl mfa enrol\fR writes the lines). Refused if world readable: it holds every second factor. Re\-read when it changes on disk,\: at most once a second,\: so enrolling and removing take effect without a reload
T}
T{
\fBissuer\fR
