T}	T{
Failures within \fBwindow\fR before the user is locked out
T}
T{
\fBwindow\fR
T}	T{
duration
T}	T{
\fB5m\fR
T}	T{
The window failures are counted in
T}
T{
\fBlockout\fR
T}	T{
duration
T}	T{
\fB15m\fR
T}	T{
How long a locked user stays locked
T}
