\fBread_\:only\fR
T}	T{
bool
T}	T{
\fBfalse\fR
T}	T{
Refuse everything that changes the server: write,\: setstat,\: remove,\: mkdir,\: rmdir,\: rename,\: symlink,\: an open with any writing flag,\: and the extensions whose meaning the proxy does not know
T}
