T}	T{
list
T}	T{
\fB[]\fR (any)
T}	T{
File extensions a name may carry,\: written without the dot and compared without case. Checked on \fBopen\fR,\: and on both names of a \fBrename\fR or a \fBsymlink\fR \[u2014] the requests that decide what a file is called. A name claiming no extension claims nothing to refuse and passes
T}
