\fBtls\fR
T}	T{
object
T}	T{
none
T}	T{
Reach the agent over HTTPS (CA,\: server name,\: pins \[u2014] as \fBupstreams[].\:tls\fR). Without it the scheme is \fBhttp\fR,\: which over loopback to a local agent is the usual arrangement
T}
