\fBtrue\fR
T}	T{
Exchange security events: honeypot marks and unmarks (applied to the peer\(aqs mark table with route \fBpeer:\:<node>/\:<route>\fR) and OIDC session revocations (per filter name). Events are bounded (128 byte kind,\: 512 byte key,\: lifetime clamped to a year),\: queued without blocking and dropped when the queue is full. Nodes older than 1.3 close a connection that carries them: set \fBfalse\fR during a rolling upgrade from 1.2
T}
