.PP
\fBParameter styles.\fR A parameter is not always one string, and OpenAPI\(aqs \fBstyle\fR and \fBexplode\fR say which spelling the operation takes. All of them are read, because a validator that assumes one refuses every request in the others \[u2014] a worse failure than not checking at all, since the request was correct and the description said so.
.PP
