T}	T{
\fB?ids=\:1&ids=\:2\fR and \fB?ids=\:1,\:2\fR;\: both are read,\: because both are unambiguous and a client may send either
T}
T{
query
T}	T{
\fBspaceDelimited\fR
T}	T{
