\fBallow_\:applications\fR
T}	T{
list
T}	T{
any
T}	T{
Matches \fBapplication_\:name\fR,\: trailing \fB*\fR allowed. Client\-chosen and not a credential;\: useful for telling a migration tool from a dashboard when both connect as the same role
T}
T{
\fBallow_\:auth\fR
T}	T{
list
T}	T{
any not weak
T}	T{
Methods the relay will carry,\: named as \fBpg_\:hba.\:conf\fR names them: \fBpassword\fR,\: \fBmd5\fR,\: \fBscram\fR,\: \fBgss\fR,\: \fBsspi\fR,\: \fBkerberos\fR,\: \fBscm\fR
T}
