\fBallow_\:weak_\:auth\fR
T}	T{
bool
T}	T{
\fBfalse\fR
T}	T{
Permit \fBpassword\fR,\: \fBmd5\fR or \fBscm\fR \-\- the methods whose credential an observer can reuse
T}
T{
\fBread_\:only\fR
T}	T{
bool
T}	T{
\fBfalse\fR
T}	T{
Refuse every statement that can change data. This includes \fBcall\fR and \fBdo\fR,\: because a procedure and an anonymous block can do anything the role can,\: and a relay that counted them reads would have a \fBread_\:only\fR that is decorative
T}
T{
\fBallow_\:statements\fR
T}	T{
list of kinds
T}	T{
any nameable
T}	T{
The allow list. Kinds: \fBselect\fR,\: \fBinsert\fR,\: \fBupdate\fR,\: \fBdelete\fR,\: \fBmerge\fR,\: \fBcopy\fR,\: \fBcall\fR,\: \fBdo\fR,\: \fBexplain\fR,\: \fBshow\fR,\: \fBset\fR,\: \fBreset\fR,\: \fBbegin\fR,\: \fBcommit\fR,\: \fBrollback\fR,\: \fBsavepoint\fR,\: \fBlock\fR,\: \fBprepare\fR,\: \fBexecute\fR,\: \fBdeallocate\fR,\: \fBdeclare\fR,\: \fBfetch\fR,\: \fBmove\fR,\: \fBclose_\:cursor\fR,\: \fBlisten\fR,\: \fBnotify\fR,\: \fBunlisten\fR,\: \fBddl\fR,\: \fBgrant\fR,\: \fBmaintenance\fR,\: \fBtwo_\:phase\fR,\: \fBempty\fR
T}
