\fB[in,\: out]\fR
T}	T{
Which \fBCOPY\fR may cross: \fBin\fR (FROM STDIN),\: \fBout\fR (TO STDOUT),\: \fBfile\fR (a path on the server,\: needing a privileged role). \fB\fBprogram\fR cannot be named at all\fR
T}
