Permit a \fBCancelRequest\fR. Worth knowing: the server acts on one with no authentication at all \-\- the whole credential is a process identifier and a 32\-bit secret. The relay cannot check the secret,\: so it refuses one from an address that is not an admitted client,\: and counts them
